<title>USA: SCPIE,CAI HEDGE FUND PICKS-BARRON'S.</title>
<headline>SCPIE,CAI HEDGE FUND PICKS-BARRON'S.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>SCPIE Holdings and CAI Wireless Systems Inc are two &quot;picks&quot; of hedge fund partners Peter Collery and Curtis Macnguyen in an interview in the August 11 issue of Barron's.</p>
<p>In the Barron's interview, Redwood Trust and GreenPoint Financial Corp are classified as the partners' &quot;pans&quot;.</p>
<p>Collery and Macnguyen are two of four partners in a hedge fund called Siegler Collery, based in Manhattan.</p>
</text>
